(
  id: "scn_m002_pawnee_fork",
  display_name: "Pawnee Fork: Hancock's Shadow",
  briefing: [
    "A week after Elk Creek, one of Teague's couriers rides west with the Ring's cipher key. Without it, Naomi's counter-book is only columns and initials; with it, every payment becomes a name.",
    "The courier has hidden among riders scavenging in the wake of Hancock's campaign. The historical column is not your target. Teague's four hired guns are.",
    "Take the cipher alive if you can. Recover it if you cannot. Do not let the Ring hide its crimes inside a larger tragedy.",
  ],
  prebattle_dialogue: [
    (speaker:"Naomi Freed", text:"That courier knows which initials bought my brother's rope.", voice:Some("m002_01_naomi.wav")),
    (speaker:"Elias Ward", text:"Then we take the key, and Teague loses the shelter of numbers.", voice:Some("m002_02_elias.wav")),
    (speaker:"Naomi Freed", text:"The old camp gives us a clean approach. Do not let the prairie turn you into a silhouette.", voice:None),
    (speaker:"Elias Ward", text:"If the courier runs, we follow his tracks. We do not chase the history happening behind him.", voice:None),
  ],
  battle_dialogue: [
    (id:"m002_move", trigger:"first_player_move", speaker:"Naomi Freed", text:"Keep to the camp edge. The wind is cover if we use it."),
    (id:"m002_shot", trigger:"first_player_shot", speaker:"Elias Ward", text:"Make the first report true. One shot, one fact."),
    (id:"m002_hit", trigger:"first_enemy_hit", speaker:"Naomi Freed", text:"They found us. Keep the courier between us and the open ground."),
    (id:"m002_down", trigger:"first_enemy_down", speaker:"Elias Ward", text:"One rider down. The key stays with the living."),
  ],
  score: Some("dust_and_ashes.wav"),
